.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "Version 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.BI "int mystrlen(const char *" s );
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBmystrlen\fR() function calculates the length of the string pointed to by \fIs\fR, excluding the terminating null byte.
.SH AUTHOR
Mazhar Shahzad
